# Inhaus Brain Agent Rules

## 1. Core Mission
- **Project**: Inhaus_Brain — Agentic AI orchestration with Flutter.
- **Directive**: Respect separation between Logic (`lib/features/chat/agents`) and Persona (`assets/prompts`).

## 2. Technical Standards
- **Stack**: Dart, Flutter (Web/Desktop), Riverpod.
- **Linting**: Follow `extra_pedantic`.
- **Testing**: Verify all new tools with tests.

## 3. Builder Constraints (Jules/Antigravity)
- **Router Agent**: Do NOT modify `router_agent.dart` without valid reason/diagram.
- **Persona Prompts**: Do NOT put code in `.md` prompts (except examples).
- **Tooling**: Add new capabilities as discrete Tools in `lib/core/tools`.

## 4. Workflow
- **Branching**: Use feature branches (`jules/fix-issue-x`).
- **Validation**: Verify UI with Agentic Browser before completing tasks.
- **Documentation**: Update `agents.md` if APIs change.

## 5. Prohibited
- **NO** deleting version comments in prompts.
- **NO** bypassing Router Agent (no direct agent-to-agent hardcoding).
- **NO** `print()` debugging (use Logger).

> **Reference**: See `agentrules.md` for full details.
